  m_text: 'Yesterday the old man eight dinner at nineteen-hundred.

    For dinner
    the old man had oatmeal which took eighteen minutes to prepare.

    The old
    man ate it up in thirteen minutes.

    Then the old man went to watch the TV
    until his wife came home at twentytwo-hundred.

'
